 Messages exist in English (`en`) and Korean (`ko`), in
 `src/i18n/messages.js`. The server answers in `LARDER_LANG` (default `en`).
+
+## Sites
+
+Send `X-Larder-Site` to select a site; the default is `main`. Header names are
+case-insensitive. An unknown site returns HTTP 400 with code `unknown_site`.
+Batches (including reads and waste), stock on hand, cooking, alerts, stock
+value and stock-takes use only locations in that site. Receiving an order
+requires locations in the selected site. Items, suppliers, recipes and dishes
+are shared.
